  "contentHtml": "\n                                    \n\n                                                                            <p><img src=\"https://health.economictimes.indiatimes.com/Themes/Release/theme4/images/icons/et-default-user.svg\" alt=\"Times News Network\">\n                                            \n                                        </p>\n                                                                        \n                                                                                    <ul>\n                                                                                                    <li>\n                                                                                                                                                                                Times News Network\n                                                                \n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        \n                                                                                                            </li>\n                                                                                                                                                    <li><a href=\"/agency/87654367/TNN\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">TNN</a></li>\n                                                                                            </ul>\n                                                                                <ul>\n                                                                                            <li>Published On Sep 21, 2026 at 04:15 PM IST</li>\n                                                                                                                                </ul>\n                                    \n                                                                            \n                                                                        \n                                \n                                \n\n                    <!-- Display video article in news article for the custom next story -->\n                    \n                    <!-- Modifying the body placing embeds,promoslots,related etc.-->\n                                        <figure><img src=\"/images/default.jpg\" alt=\"\"></figure><p>Kozhikode:The health department has intensified preventive and containment measures following a <a href=\"/tag/measles+outbreak\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">measles outbreak</a> in <a href=\"/tag/valavannur+health+block\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Valavannur health block</a> of <a href=\"/tag/malappuram+district\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Malappuram district</a>.This month alone, health officials reported 98 suspected cases — presenting with fever and rashes — alongside six laboratory-confirmed cases in Valavannur and neighbouring areas. Additionally, one death reported last month is suspected to be linked to the disease.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>A senior health official highlighted that the vast majority of cases involve children, nearly 70% of whom had not received the MMR (measles, mumps and rubella) vaccine. Malappuram district medical officer (DMO) <a href=\"/tag/dr+vinod+v\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Dr Vinod V</a> expressed concern over persistent <a href=\"/tag/vaccination+gaps\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">vaccination gaps</a> in the region despite several targeted <a href=\"/tag/immunisation+drives\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">immunisation drives</a>.</p>\n                            <p>Advt\n                            </p>\n\n                              \n                                                         \n                        <p>“We have urged religious authorities, including mosques, to give the message during prayers about the need to get vaccinated. Also, schools have been asked to convene special assembly to spread awareness,” he said.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>Steps had been taken to organise special <a href=\"/tag/awareness+programmes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">awareness programmes</a> and <a href=\"/tag/vaccination+camps\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">vaccination camps</a> in the affected areas. The disease has also been reported in areas including Athavanad, Kalpakanchery, Thanaloor and other areas.The district witnessed a measles outbreak in 2023. Health authorities said that people should not send kids with symptoms to schools.Measles is a highly contagious, airborne disease caused by a virus in the paramyxovirus family. The virus infects the respiratory tract and then spreads through the body. It spreads easily when an infected person breathes, coughs or sneezes. It can cause severe disease, complications and even death. Symptoms of measles usually begin 7–14 days after exposure to the virus.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>A prominent rash is the most visible symptom. Early symptoms usually last 4-7 days. They include fever, a runny nose, cough, red and watery eyes, small white spots inside the cheeks.Community-wide vaccination is the most effective way to prevent measles. Children should receive two doses of the vaccine to ensure they are immune. The first dose is usually given at 9 months of age and the next at 15 months.                    </p><!-- Category Most Read Placement -->\n                                                                    \n                                                                \n                                <ul>\n                                                                            <!-- <li>By <span>Times News Network</span>,</li> -->\n                                    \n\n                                                                            <li>By\n                                                                                            <a>Times News Network</a>\n\n                                                                                                                                                                                        , \n                                                                                    </li>\n                                                                        <li><a href=\"/agency/87654367/TNN\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">TNN</a></li>\n                                </ul>\n                                <ul>\n                                    <!-- <li> Updated On Sep 21, 2026 at 04:15 PM IST</li> -->\n                                    <li>Published On Sep 21, 2026 at 04:15 PM IST</li>\n                                    <!-- <li class=\"desktop-view\">2 min read</li> -->\n                                </ul>\n                            \n                                        \n\n                    \n\n                    <!-- Comment Section -->\n                                            \n                                        <!-- Comment Section -->\n\n                    \n                      \n    \n            <p>\n                </p><h2>Join the community of 2M+ industry professionals. </h2>   \n                <h3>Subscribe to Newsletter to get latest insights &amp; analysis in your inbox.</h3>\n            <p></p>\n\n            <!-- <figure class=\"top-newsletter-subs__icon-nl\" role=\"presentation\" aria-label=\"Newsletter icon\">\n                <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://st.etb2bimg.com/Themes/Release/theme4/images/icons/icon-newsletter.svg\" alt=\"Newsletter icon\" width=\"55\" height=\"55\">\n            </figure> -->\n        \n            \n                \n                    <h2>All about ETHealthworld industry r